<figure><img alt=\"Feanna 黃淑蔓。(胡凱欣 攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148112877669191680546930.jpeg/6CQE7Ke1lSu6jCN9u2Ehc12SeJ0lF5vcGuAZdiDgGXY\"/><figcaption>Feanna 黃淑蔓。(胡凱欣 攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Janice Vidal 衛蘭。(胡凱欣 攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148112874313617408369814.jpeg/R02KYZLKfZ-4_rHR9lB4F7gxUsFulIcX6rknP9C5Jz8\"/><figcaption>Janice Vidal 衛蘭。(胡凱欣 攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馬天佑。(胡凱欣 攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148112870802853888824375.jpeg/FXj9ki0cEQ_nprl964SpXPqmuKozyAtERV5OAn9eTgI\"/><figcaption>馬天佑。(胡凱欣 攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"waa wei 魏如萱。(胡凱欣 攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148112866499366912547631.jpeg/4AsgycKBlrPv3x_mi8YEe0uT6sOYTgJ9jYANMreADTI\"/><figcaption>waa wei 魏如萱。(胡凱欣 攝)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T04:22:30.032059+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1425,"images":26,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}